<https://schema.org/hasMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A measurement of an item, For example, the inseam of pants, the wheel size of a bicycle, the gauge of a screw, or the carbon footprint measured for certification by an authority. Usually an exact measurement, but can also be a range of measurements for adjustable products, for example belts and ski bindings." _:df_0_4 .
