<https://schema.org/mobileUrl> <https://schema.org/isPartOf> <https://pending.schema.org> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/mobileUrl> <https://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <https://schema.org/Text> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/mobileUrl> <https://schema.org/source> <https://github.com/schemaorg/schemaorg/issues/3134> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/mobileUrl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/model> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The model of the product. Use with the URL of a ProductModel or a textual representation of the model identifier. The URL of the ProductModel can be from an external source. It is recommended to additionally provide strong product identifiers via the gtin8/gtin13/gtin14 and mpn properties." _:df_0_4 .
