<https://schema.org/vehicleInteriorType> <https://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <https://schema.org/Text> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/vehicleInteriorType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/vehicleModelDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The release date of a vehicle model (often used to differentiate versions of the same make and model)." _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/vehicleModelDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vehicleModelDate" _:df_0_4 .
