<https://schema.org/vehicleSeatingCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of passengers that can be seated in the vehicle, both in terms of the physical space available, and in terms of limitations set by law.\\n\\nTypical unit code(s): C62 for persons." _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/vehicleSeatingCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vehicleSeatingCapacity" _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/vehicleSeatingCapacity> <https://schema.org/contributor> <https://schema.org/docs/collab/Automotive_Ontology_Working_Group> _:df_0_4 .
<https://schema.org/vehicleSeatingCapacity> <https://schema.org/domainIncludes> <https://schema.org/Vehicle> _:df_0_4 .
