<https://schema.org/vehicleTransmission> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The type of component used for transmitting the power from a rotating power source to the wheels or other relevant component(s) (\"gearbox\" for cars)." _:df_0_4 .
