<https://schema.org/wheelbase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The distance between the centers of the front and rear wheels.\\n\\nTypical unit code(s): CMT for centimeters, MTR for meters, INH for inches, FOT for foot/feet." _:df_0_4 .
